      "sec": "brochure",
      "src": 91,
      "url": null,
      "v": "GENERAL: benefits will not be paid for treatment, services or supplies which are not Medically Necessary; are not prescribed by a Doctor as necessary to treat Sickness or injury; are experimental/investigational except as required by law; are received without charge or legal obligation to pay; or are provided by an immediate family member. ADDITIONAL, for sickness or injuries caused by: DENTAL PROCEDURES - dental care or treatment except for accidental injury to SOUND NATURAL TEETH within 12 months of the accident, and except where necessary due to congenital disease or anomaly. ELECTIVE PROCEDURES AND COSMETIC SURGERY, with reconstructive exceptions. FELONY OR ILLEGAL OCCUPATION. MANIPULATIONS OF THE MUSCULOSKELETAL SYSTEM. SUICIDE, attempted suicide or intentionally self-inflicted injury, 'WHETHER SANE OR INSANE'. WAR OR ACT OF WAR, riot, insurrection, service in the Armed Forces - but losses from acts of terrorism are NOT excluded unless the covered person who suffered the loss committed the act. WORK-RELATED INJURY OR SICKNESS, whether or not workers' compensation benefits are payable. PREGNANCY.",
